                <pb facs="0371" n="359" sameAs="frus:frus1945v08/pg359"/>

                <head>Chapter I: January 1 to November 18, 1945</head>
                <p>Soviet Army interference with the movement of Iranian security forces in northern
                    Iran; discussions at the Malta and Yalta Conferences on the presence of foreign
                    troops in Iran; identic Iranian notes of May 19, 1945, requesting withdrawal of
                    foreign troops from Iran; Three Power agreement at the Potsdam Conference to
                    evacuate Tehran; further Soviet interference with attempted Iranian security
                    measures in northern Iran; Anglo-Soviet exchanges on troop withdrawal during the
                    London Meeting of the Council of Foreign Ministers</p>





























































































